# Deny-by-default, same pattern as the website repo.
#
# This working tree holds real share counts, real dollar values and a
# market-data API key. Nothing is tracked unless it is named below, so a
# new private file cannot be swallowed into a commit by accident.
#
# NEVER allowlist: private/, out/, .env*, node_modules/
# Adding a new source file means adding its ! entry here (parent dirs too).

*

!/.gitignore
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/package.json
!/docs/
!/docs/**
!/src/
!/src/**
!/scripts/
!/scripts/**
!/tests/
!/tests/**

# Re-deny, even if a pattern above would otherwise reach them.
/private/
/out/
/node_modules/
.env
.env.*
*.log
